{
  "id": "864",
  "title": "Laughter? Younger?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-01-11",
  "synopsis": "Have you heard this Chinese saying? It is similar to “Laughter is the best medicine”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/864/8cbc50f553032ec89facb674244ec0120bd59968.mp3?1578130800",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "笑一笑，十年少\n\n本：丽丽，以后我们都不要笑了。\n丽丽：为什么？\n本：你不知道吗？我今天学了你们中国的一句话，叫：笑一笑，十年少（第三声）。你想想，我们人也就能活到100岁吧？笑一下，就要少十年。我们不能再笑了。\n丽丽：本，那句话叫“笑一笑，十年少”。这个“少”有两个读音，“多少”的“少”和“男女老少”的“少”。这句话的意思是说，你笑一下，就可以年轻十岁。\n本：原来是这个意思。那我要多笑，哈哈哈！哈哈哈哈！",
    "traditional": "笑一笑，十年少\n\n本：麗麗，以後我們都不要笑了。\n麗麗：為什麼？\n本：你不知道嗎？我今天學了你們中國的一句話，叫：笑一笑，十年少（第三聲）。你想想，我們人也就能活到100歲吧？笑一下，就要少十年。我們不能再笑了。\n麗麗：本，那句話叫“笑一笑，十年少”。這個“少”有兩個讀音，“多少”的“少”和“男女老少”的“少”。這句話的意思是說，你笑一下，就可以年輕十歲。\n本：原來是這個意思。那我要多笑，哈哈哈！哈哈哈哈！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Laughter is the best medicine"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，以后我们都不要笑了。",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，以後我們都不要笑了。",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì yǐ hòu wǒ men dōu bú yào xiào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, we can’t laugh from now on."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：为什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你不知道吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你不知道嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ bù zhī dào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我今天学了你们中国的一句话，叫：笑一笑，十年少（第三声）。",
      "traditional": "我今天學了你們中國的一句話，叫：笑一笑，十年少（第三聲）。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jīn tiān xué le nǐ men zhōng guó de yí jù huà jiào xiào yì xiào shí nián shǎo dì sān shēng",
      "english": "Ben: Don’t you know?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "你想想，我们人也就能活到100岁吧？",
      "traditional": "你想想，我們人也就能活到100歲吧？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ xiǎng xiǎng wǒ men rén yě jiù néng huó dào 2 suì ba",
      "english": "I learned today that you have a saying in China, called: Laugh a bit and lose ten years (in the third tone)."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "笑一下，就要少十年。我们不能再笑了。",
      "traditional": "笑一下，就要少十年。我們不能再笑了。",
      "pinyin": "xiào yí xià jiù yào shǎo shí nián wǒ men bù néng zài xiào le",
      "english": "You think about it, people only live until about a hundred years old, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Laugh for a moment, and you have ten years less. We can’t laugh anymore."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "丽丽：本，那句话叫“笑一笑，十年少”。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：本，那句話叫“笑一笑，十年少”。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì běn nà jù huà jiào xiào yí xiào shí nián shào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "这个“少”有两个读音，“多少”的“少”和“男女老少”的“少”。",
      "traditional": "這個“少”有兩個讀音，“多少”的“少”和“男女老少”的“少”。",
      "pinyin": "zhè ge shào yǒu liǎng ge dú yīn duō shao de shǎo hé nán nǚ lǎo shào de shào",
      "english": "Lili: Ben, that saying is called “Laugh a bit, and get ten years younger”."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "这句话的意思是说，你笑一下，就可以年轻十岁。",
      "traditional": "這句話的意思是說，你笑一下，就可以年輕十歲。",
      "pinyin": "zhè jù huà de yì si shì shuō nǐ xiào yí xià jiù kě yǐ nián qīng shí suì",
      "english": "This \"shao\" has two pronunciations, the “shǎo” in “how much” and the “shào” in “men, women, old and young”."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This saying means to say, that if you laugh for a bit, you get ten years younger."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "本：原来是这个意思。那我要多笑，哈哈哈！哈哈哈哈！",
      "traditional": "本：原來是這個意思。那我要多笑，哈哈哈！哈哈哈哈！",
      "pinyin": "běn yuán lái shì zhè ge yì si nà wǒ yào duō xiào hā hā hā hā hā hā hā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: So it actually has this meaning. Then I will laugh more, hahaha! Hahahaha!"
    }
  ],
